    <bpmn:process id="W_W283" name="W283. B2B Punchout Catalog Integration (cXML)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: A corporate client initiates a purchase directly from their own procurement system (e.g., SAP Ariba, Coupa) into our B2B catalog.
Frequency: Daily
Volume: High volume for enterprise clients
Owner: B2B E-commerce Manager
Participants: Corporate Buyer, B2B IT Admin, Fulfillment Team
Source: workflow W283 — B2B Punchout Catalog Integration (cXML)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W283_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W283_Lane1" name="Corporate Buyer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W283_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W283_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W283_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W283_Lane2" name="Client ERP System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W283_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W283_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W283_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W283_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W283_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W283_Start5" name="A corporate client initiates a purchase directly from their own procurement system (e.g…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W283_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W283_Task6" name="Buyer clicks &quot;BuildRight Depot&quot; in their procurement system (SAP Ariba, Coupa)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Buyer clicks &quot;BuildRight Depot&quot; in their procurement system (SAP Ariba, Coupa), initiating a cXML punchout session that logs them into our B2B portal with their negotiated pricing (W163)
Responsible (R): Corporate Buyer
Accountable (A): B2B E-commerce Manager
Duration: 30 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W283_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W283_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W283_Task7" name="Buyer adds items to cart and checks out, returning the cart data (cXML…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Buyer adds items to cart and checks out, returning the cart data (cXML PunchOutOrderMessage) to their ERP for internal manager approval
Responsible (R): Corporate Buyer
Accountable (A): Corporate Approver
Duration: 5-10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W283_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W283_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W283_Task8" name="Once approved internally, their ERP sends a cXML Purchase Order automatically…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Once approved internally, their ERP sends a cXML Purchase Order automatically to our ERP via the EDI gateway
Responsible (R): Client ERP System
Accountable (A): B2B IT Admin
Duration: &lt; 1 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W283_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W283_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W283_Task9" name="Our ERP validates the PO against the client&#x27;s contract price book (W163)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Our ERP validates the PO against the client&#x27;s contract price book (W163), converts it into a Sales Order, and triggers bulk fulfillment (W146)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): B2B Sales Mgr
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W283_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W283_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W283_Task10" name="Upon dispatch, our ERP transmits an Advanced Shipping Notice (ASN) via cXML to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Upon dispatch, our ERP transmits an Advanced Shipping Notice (ASN) via cXML to the client&#x27;s ERP; upon delivery confirmation, a cXML Invoice is sent for payment
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): AR Clerk
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W283_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W283_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W283_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W283_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W283_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-274 (ensure controlled execution — Wholesale Operations (PA-11.3).) | - operational: B2B E-commerce Manager review and approval gate
Owner: B2B E-commerce Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
